.TH MYSTRLEN 3 "September 2026" "OS Assignment 01" "Library Functions"

.SH NAME
mystrlen \- calculate the length of a string

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B #include "mystrfunctions.h"
.br
.B int mystrlen(const char *s);

.SH DESCRIPTION
The mystrlen function calculates the number of characters in the string pointed to by s.

